{"4135380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wink Out", "steam_appid": 4135380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wink Out is a fast-paced 1v1 shooter where clever card synergies and chaotic combat create unpredictable knockout battles. Craft clever builds, adapt between rounds, and send your rivals flying out of the arena in chaotic physics-driven battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across procedurally generated mirrored arenas designed for fair, competitive fights. Trade shots, time your abilities, and use physics-based knockback to outplay your rivals in fast-changing battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, both players enter a shared card shop to evolve their builds. With tons of cards to experiment with, every match offers new synergies, counter plays, and chaotic moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a built-in comeback economy, every round stays competitive, giving trailing players the chance to shift momentum and turn the fight around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven knockout combat inspired by platform brawlers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared card shop with evolving builds and strategic counter play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ unique cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comeback-focused economy that keeps matches competitive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated mirrored arenas for fair competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online matches are organized through our Discord community</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wink Out is a fast-paced 1v1 shooter where clever card synergies and chaotic combat create unpredictable knockout battles. Craft clever builds, adapt between rounds, and send your rivals flying out of the arena in chaotic physics-driven battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across procedurally generated mirrored arenas designed for fair, competitive fights. Trade shots, time your abilities, and use physics-based knockback to outplay your rivals in fast-changing battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, both players enter a shared card shop to evolve their builds. With tons of cards to experiment with, every match offers new synergies, counter plays, and chaotic moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a built-in comeback economy, every round stays competitive, giving trailing players the chance to shift momentum and turn the fight around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven knockout combat inspired by platform brawlers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared card shop with evolving builds and strategic counter play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ unique cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comeback-focused economy that keeps matches competitive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated mirrored arenas for fair competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online matches are organized through our Discord community</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Wink Out your rivals in this physics-driven 1v1 shooter! Craft clever card synergies, adapt between rounds, and outplay opponents by sending them flying out of the arena.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135380/871afffe061258c258c171c40532b58a26abb550/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1787155988", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135380/c8b46fd988656c055e3f05ec80377e59143ad912/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1787155988